{"id":4565,"name":"Maebashi Witches","slug":"maebashi_witches","synopsis":"Yuina Akagi is an ordinary high school freshman in Maebashi City, Gunma Prefecture—until a talking frog named Keroppe appears and throws an unexpected proposal her way:\n\n\"Why don't you become a witch?\"\n\nBefore she knows it, Yuina's closet becomes a gateway to a mysterious world, where she meets four other girls—each with their own quirks and magical potential. There's the fiery Azu Niisato, the level-headed Kyouka Kitahara, the ever-optimistic Choco Mitsumata, and the carefree Mai Kamiizumi.\n\nTogether, they form the Maebashi Witches, a group dedicated to granting people's wishes through magic, music, and a bit of mayhem. Their base of operation? A charming little flower shop in the heart of the shopping district—where the flowers of the heart can finally bloom.\n\nWith a little magic and a lot of heart, their new life as witches is about to begin.","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":2025,"createdAt":"2025-04-16 23:47:42","updatedAt":"2025-04-16 23:47:42","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"LIVECHART","externalId":12824},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":18855},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":180825},{"site":"ANN","externalId":33470},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":49182},{"site":"MAL","externalId":59744},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":12625,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/RqzvwzujiIb1MIOwGmxkjtFkfqLqTsPQEzjqSFU3.avif"},{"id":12626,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/BlOu8LuJlBJQCCLCSeIQcCrN4WSkPme74VLpZYM6.jpg"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":25,"name":"Sunrise","slug":"sunrise"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":13643,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":13566,"title":"Sugosugi Maebashi Witches!","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":15953,"version":1,"episodes":"1-12","nsfw":false,